  - id: the_lords_day_of_wrath
    displayName: The Cloud of His Anger (The LORD's Day of Wrath)
    flavorText: Describes the LORD himself as an enemy who has swallowed up Israel,
      tearing down her sanctuary, king, and feast days in his fierce anger.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Names the LORD himself as the direct agent of Jerusalem's destruction,
      cataloguing the ruin of sanctuary, king, and feast days, and indicting the
      nation's prophets for failing to warn the people.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: the_lords_day_of_wrath
