  - id: compassions_new_every_morning
    displayName: New Every Morning (Great Is Thy Faithfulness)
    flavorText: A sufferer afflicted by the rod of God's wrath turns at the poem's
      center to declare that the LORD's compassions are new every morning and his
      faithfulness is great.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'The book''s theological center: a single sufferer descends into personal
      darkness under God''s discipline, then turns to the book''s most famous affirmation
      of hope before returning to lament.'
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: compassions_new_every_morning
    icon: {fileID: 0}
