  - id: the_siege_and_the_fallen_crown
    displayName: The Fallen Crown (Siege and Famine)
    flavorText: Contrasts Zion's former golden splendor with the horrors of siege
      famine, corrupt priests and prophets, and the capture of the LORD's anointed
      king.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Contrasts Zion's former glory with the horrors of the siege's famine,
      lays blame on corrupt priests and prophets, and mourns the capture of the anointed
      of the LORD, closing with a taunt against Edom.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: the_siege_and_the_fallen_crown
