  - id: prayer_for_remembrance
    displayName: Remember, O LORD (Prayer for Restoration)
    flavorText: The community prays as one voice for the LORD to remember their reproach
      and turn them back to himself, ending without a guaranteed answer.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: A closing communal prayer asking the LORD to remember and behold the
      nation's reproach and to turn the people back to himself, deliberately left
      unresolved rather than triumphantly answered.
